    "poang": "(2/1/0)",
    "t": "<p>Diagrammet visar en spridd mätserie för massa och volym.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"480\" height=\"323\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 350\" style=\"display:block;width:480px;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:323px;margin:12px auto\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Massa och volym med spridda mätpunkter\"><title>Massa och volym med spridda mätpunkter</title><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">0</text><line x1=\"114.375\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"114.375\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"114.375\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">1</text><line x1=\"163.75\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"163.75\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"163.75\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">2</text><line x1=\"213.125\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"213.125\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"213.125\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">3</text><line x1=\"262.5\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"262.5\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"262.5\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">4</text><line x1=\"311.875\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"311.875\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"311.875\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">5</text><line x1=\"361.25\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"361.25\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"361.25\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">6</text><line x1=\"410.625\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"410.625\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"410.625\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">7</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"460\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">8</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"279\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">0</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"246.875\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"246.875\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"250.875\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">10</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"218.75\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"218.75\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"222.75\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">20</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"190.625\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"190.625\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"194.625\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">30</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"162.5\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"162.5\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"166.5\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">40</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"134.375\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"134.375\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"138.375\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">50</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"106.25\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"106.25\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"110.25\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">60</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"78.125\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"78.125\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"82.125\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">70</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"54\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">80</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"463\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#293747\">Massa (g)</text><text x=\"462\" y=\"329\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">Volym (cm³)</text><circle cx=\"114.375\" cy=\"244.85\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"153.875\" cy=\"244.34375\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"203.25\" cy=\"196.75625\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"252.625\" cy=\"191.1875\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"297.0625\" cy=\"174.425\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"346.4375\" cy=\"130.634375\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"390.875\" cy=\"124.02499999999998\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"435.3125\" cy=\"93.76249999999999\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/></svg></span><p>a) Bestäm en rimlig densitet genom att använda hela mätserien.</p><p>b) Använd ditt värde för att uppskatta massan hos 6,0 cm³ av ämnet.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Massa och volym hänger ihop genom m = ρV. Densiteten är därför lutningen i ett massa–volym-diagram. Anpassa en rät linje genom origo som följer hela mätserien. Använd två punkter på linjen, inte två godtyckliga mätpunkter.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\rho=\\frac{\\Delta m}{\\Delta V}\\approx\\frac{42-0}{5-0}=8{,}4\\ \\mathrm{g/cm^3}\\]</div><p>Avläsningen är ungefärlig. Lite olika lutningar är rimliga eftersom mätpunkterna har en tydlig spridning.</p></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Den beräknade massan ska följa den anpassade linjen, även om en närliggande mätpunkt ligger lite vid sidan om.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[m=\\rho V\\approx8{,}4\\cdot6{,}0=50{,}4\\ \\mathrm g\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Cirka 8,4 g/cm³ och 50 g.</p></div>",
