    "id": "2.119",
    "kap": 2,
    "omr": "densitet",
    "niva": "E",
    "typ": "bestämma massa från densitet och rätblockets volym",
    "poang": "(1/0/0)",
    "t": "<p>Ett massivt aluminiumblock har måtten 12 cm, 5,0 cm och 2,0 cm. Aluminium har densiteten 2,70 g/cm³. Bestäm blockets massa.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"480\" height=\"266\" viewBox=\"0 0 550 305\" style=\"display:block;width:480px;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:266px;margin:12px auto\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rätblock med mått utanför respektive kant\"><title>Rätblock med mått utanför respektive kant</title><path d=\"M70,133 l85,-65 h245 l-85,65 Z\" fill=\"#e4edf3\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"70\" y=\"133\" width=\"245\" height=\"80\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#f9fbfc\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><path d=\"M315,133 l85,-65 v80 l-85,65 Z\" fill=\"#cbdde8\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"217\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"243\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"315\" y1=\"217\" x2=\"315\" y2=\"243\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"238\" x2=\"315\" y2=\"238\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"234\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"315\" y1=\"234\" x2=\"315\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"192.5\" y=\"261\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">12 cm</text><line x1=\"317.4298004302832\" y1=\"216.1774313319088\" x2=\"336.2607537649779\" y2=\"240.80252415420188\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"402.4298004302832\" y1=\"151.1774313319088\" x2=\"421.2607537649779\" y2=\"175.80252415420188\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"333.2235032271239\" y1=\"236.83073498931589\" x2=\"418.2235032271239\" y2=\"171.83073498931589\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"330.7937027968407\" y1=\"233.6533036574071\" x2=\"335.6533036574071\" y2=\"240.00816632122468\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"415.7937027968407\" y1=\"168.6533036574071\" x2=\"420.6533036574071\" y2=\"175.00816632122468\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"386.6576051633983\" y=\"223.62917598290542\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">5,0 cm</text><line x1=\"404\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"404\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"445\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"445\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"441\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"449\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line x1=\"441\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"449\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#8494a0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"457\" y=\"113\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#293747\">2,0 cm</text></svg></span>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Beräkna först volymen och använd sedan \\(m=\\rho V\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[V = 12\\cdot 5{,}0\\cdot 2{,}0 = 120\\ \\mathrm{cm^3}\\]</div><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[m = \\rho V = 2{,}70\\cdot 120 = 324\\ \\mathrm{g}\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> cirka \\(324\\ \\mathrm{g}\\).</p></div>",
    "familj": "Densitet med geometri och volymberäkning",
    "familjNyckel": "densitet__densitet_med_geometri_och_volymberakning",
