    "spelIntro": "<p>En bil kör i 25 m/s och ska köra om en lastbil som håller 20 m/s. Bilen måste förflytta sig 100 m i förhållande till lastbilen.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"142\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 41.189 430.000 98.361\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"92\" width=\"410\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#E5EDF4\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"36\" y=\"62\" width=\"86\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"58,62 70,48 98,48 108,62\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"84\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"54\" cy=\"84\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"104\" cy=\"84\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"73\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><polygon points=\"200,73 190,77.6 190,68.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v = 25 m/s</text><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"123\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"133\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"410\" y1=\"123\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"133\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">100 m</text></svg></span>",
