    "t": "<p>En dynamometer innehåller en fjäder. När en vikt med massan 250 g hängs i den dras fjädern ut 4,0 cm.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg height=\"209\" width=\"380\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"68.514 8.810 292.286 161.088\"><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"26\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"138\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"158\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"168\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"178\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"188\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"198\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"218\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"230\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"238\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"248\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"268\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"278\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"288\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><polyline points=\"200,26 189,29.46 211,36.38 189,43.31 211,50.23 189,57.15 211,64.08 189,71 211,77.92 189,84.85 211,91.77 189,98.69 211,105.62 200,116\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"116\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"126\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"174\" y=\"126\" width=\"52\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E5EDF4\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">250 g</text><line x1=\"158\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"188\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><line x1=\"212\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"286\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><line x1=\"286\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"286\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"286,86 283,93 289,93\" fill=\"#5C575E\"/><polygon points=\"286,116 283,109 289,109\" fill=\"#5C575E\"/><text x=\"294\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Δl = 4,0 cm</text><text x=\"152\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">obelastat läge</text></svg></span><ol><li>Hur stor är tyngdkraften på vikten?</li>\n<li>Bestäm fjäderns fjäderkonstant.</li>\n<li>Hur långt dras fjädern ut om man i stället drar i den med kraften 6,0 N?</li>\n<li>Vilken massa ska hängas i för att fjädern ska dras ut 10 cm?</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Omvandla massan till kilogram.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F_g=0{,}250\\cdot9{,}82=2{,}455\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Förlängningen 4,0 cm är 0,040 m.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[k=\\frac{2{,}455}{0{,}040}=61{,}4\\ \\mathrm{N/m}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Vid dragkraften 6,0 N blir</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[x=\\frac{6{,}0}{61{,}4}=0{,}0978\\ \\mathrm m=9{,}78\\ \\mathrm{cm}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Först bestäms kraften vid 10 cm och därefter massan.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F=61{,}4\\cdot0{,}10=6{,}14\\ \\mathrm N\\]\\[m=\\frac{6{,}14}{9{,}82}=0{,}625\\ \\mathrm{kg}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Tyngdkraften är \\(2{,}46\\ \\mathrm N\\), \\(k=61{,}4\\ \\mathrm{N/m}\\), 6,0 N ger \\(9{,}78\\ \\mathrm{cm}\\), och 10 cm kräver massan cirka \\(0{,}625\\ \\mathrm{kg}\\).</p></div>",
