        "t": "<p>På en kropp med massan 10 kg verkar två vinkelräta krafter enligt figuren.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg height=\"261\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewbox=\"129.143 13.735 238.286 163.675\" width=\"380\"><rect fill=\"#ECEFF3\" height=\"50\" rx=\"3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"80\" x=\"140\" y=\"118\"></rect><text fill=\"#2B2527\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"180\" y=\"148\">10 kg</text><line stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" x1=\"220\" x2=\"296\" y1=\"143\" y2=\"143\"></line><polygon fill=\"#B43123\" points=\"306.00,143.00 296.00,147.60 296.00,138.40\"></polygon><text fill=\"#B43123\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\" x=\"312\" y=\"139\">F₁ = 40 N</text><line stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" x1=\"180\" x2=\"180\" y1=\"118\" y2=\"50\"></line><polygon fill=\"#B43123\" points=\"180.00,40.00 184.60,50.00 175.40,50.00\"></polygon><text fill=\"#B43123\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"180\" y=\"30\">F₂ = 30 N</text></svg></span><div class=\"spel-en-del\">Bestäm kroppens acceleration.</div>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Accelerationen får samma riktning som resultanten.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[a=\\frac{50}{10}=5{,}0\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(5{,}0\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}\\).</p></div>",
        "ledtrad": "<p>Accelerationen får samma riktning som resultanten. Frilägg föremålet och välj en positiv riktning.</p>",
        "niva": "E",
