    "spelIntro": "<p>Man drar med kraften 200 N i änden av en 0,35 m lång nyckel. Kraften bildar vinkeln 55° mot nyckeln istället för att vara vinkelrät.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"263\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"34.971 56.311 305.029 129.612\"><polygon points=\"70.0,96.0 90.8,108.0 90.8,132.0 70.0,144.0 49.2,132.0 49.2,108.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"111\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"311.5\" y2=\"74.9\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"311.5,74.9 301.7,80.3 309.9,86.0\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"321.5\" y=\"70.9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">F</text><path d=\"M314.0,120.0 A34,34 0 0,0 299.5,92.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"320.0\" y=\"102.0\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5C575E\">55°</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#5C575E\">0,35 m</text></svg></span>",
