    "ledtrad": "<p>Välj höger som positiv riktning. Krafterna verkar åt motsatta håll.</p>",
    "spelDelning": "deluppgifter",
    "spelIntro": "<p>Figuren visar krafterna på en låda med massan 6,0 kg.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"106\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 25.714 400.000 68.571\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"80\" width=\"370\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\"/><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"385\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"157\" y=\"32\" width=\"76\" height=\"48\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"233\" y1=\"56\" x2=\"275\" y2=\"56\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"285,56 275,60.6 275,51.4\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"305\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">42 N</text><line x1=\"157\" y1=\"56\" x2=\"135.8\" y2=\"55.99999999999999\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"125.8,55.99999999999999 135.8,51.39999999999999 135.8,60.599999999999994\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"105.8\" y=\"59.99999999999999\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">15 N</text></svg></span>",
