    "niva": "C",
    "typ": "bestämma fjäderkonstant ur längdändring och beräkna ny längd vid annan last, ur diagram, sökt förlängning fjäderkonstant och längd",
    "poang": "(2/1/0)",
    "t": "<p>En fjäder hänger i taket. Obelastad är den 20 cm lång. När en vikt på 500 g hängs i blir den 26 cm lång.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"297\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"48.600 13.785 314.400 150.442\"><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"128\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"138\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"158\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"168\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"178\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"188\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"198\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"218\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"230\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"238\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"248\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"268\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"278\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"288\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"298\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><polyline points=\"200,44 211,46.4615 189,51.3846 211,56.3077 189,61.2308 211,66.1538 189,71.0769 211,76 189,80.9231 211,85.8462 189,90.7692 211,95.6923 189,100.615 200,108\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"172\" y=\"122\" width=\"56\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"143\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">500 g</text><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"295\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"305\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"295\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"305\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">l = 26 cm</text><line x1=\"115\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"115\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"107\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">l₀ = 20 cm</text></svg></span>\n<ol><li>Hur mycket har fjädern förlängts?</li>\n<li>Hur stor är tyngdkraften på vikten?</li>\n<li>Bestäm fjäderkonstanten.</li>\n<li>Hur lång blir fjädern om man i stället hänger i en vikt på 1,2 kg?</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Förlängningen är skillnaden mellan belastad och obelastad längd.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[x=26-20=6{,}0\\ \\mathrm{cm}=0{,}060\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Viktens tyngdkraft är</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F_g=0{,}500\\cdot9{,}82=4{,}91\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Vid jämvikt gäller \\(kx=mg\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[k=\\frac{4{,}91}{0{,}060}=81{,}8\\ \\mathrm{N/m}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Beräkna först den nya förlängningen och lägg sedan till den obelastade längden.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[x_2=\\frac{1{,}2\\cdot9{,}82}{81{,}8}=0{,}144\\ \\mathrm m\\]\\[l_2=0{,}200+0{,}144=0{,}344\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Fjäderkonstanten är cirka \\(81{,}8\\ \\mathrm{N/m}\\), och med massan 1,2 kg blir fjäderns hela längd cirka \\(34{,}4\\ \\mathrm{cm}\\).</p></div>",
