    "spelIntro": "<p>En låda på 15 kg står på ett bord. Ovanpå den ligger en låda på 6,0 kg.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"271\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"16.914 50.228 286.171 125.114\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"160\" width=\"260\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"100\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"58\" width=\"60\" height=\"42\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><polygon points=\"160,70 164.6,80 155.4,80\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"88\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">N₁</text><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><polygon points=\"140,120 144.6,130 135.4,130\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"148\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">N₂</text><line x1=\"226\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"192\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">övre lådan</text><line x1=\"226\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"212\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">undre lådan</text></svg></span>",
