        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Bordet bär båda lådorna. Frilägg hela stapeln.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[N_2=(m_{\\mathrm{u}}+m_{\\mathrm{ö}})g\\]\\[N_2=(15+6{,}0)9{,}82=206\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(206\\ \\mathrm N\\).</p></div>",
