        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Konstant hastighet innebär att tryckkraften balanserar friktionen.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[52=\\mu mg\\Rightarrow m=\\frac{52}{0{,}35\\cdot9{,}82}=15{,}13\\ \\mathrm{kg}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(15{,}13\\ \\mathrm{kg}\\).</p></div>",
