        "fraga": "Hur stor kraft drar Ellen med?",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Konstant hastighet innebär noll vågrät resultant.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F_D=f=23{,}6\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(23{,}6\\ \\mathrm N\\).</p></div>",
