    "spelDelning": "deluppgifter",
    "spelIntro": "<p>En balk vilar på ett stöd. Två laster hänger enligt figuren.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"246\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"127.571 36.288 316.243 125.664\"><line x1=\"141.8\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"429\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><polygon points=\"235,49 218,86 252,86\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"167.8\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"167.8\" y2=\"94\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"167.8,104 163.2,94 172.4,94\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><line x1=\"403\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"403\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"403,74 398.4,64 407.6,64\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"167.8\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">600 N</text><text x=\"403\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">240 N</text><line x1=\"167.8\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"167.8\" y1=\"131\" x2=\"167.8\" y2=\"141\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"235\" y1=\"131\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"141\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"201.4\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">0,8 m</text><line x1=\"235\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"403\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"235\" y1=\"131\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"141\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"403\" y1=\"131\" x2=\"403\" y2=\"141\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"319\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">2,0 m</text></svg></span>",
