    "spelIntro": "<p>En bil med massan 1400 kg bogserar en släpvagn med massan 600 kg. Ekipaget startar från vila och accelererar med 0,80 m/s².</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"160\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 24.419 380.000 98.217\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"110\" width=\"350\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#E5EDF4\"/><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"45\" y=\"68\" width=\"80\" height=\"28\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E5EDF4\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#2B2527\">600 kg</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"102\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"105\" cy=\"102\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"125\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"165\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"195,64 265,64 250,46 210,46\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"165\" y=\"64\" width=\"130\" height=\"32\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#E5EDF4\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#2B2527\">1400 kg</text><circle cx=\"192\" cy=\"101\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"272\" cy=\"101\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"338,34 328,29.4 328,38.6\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"344\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">a</text></svg></span>",
