    "niva": "C",
    "poang": "(1/2/0)",
    "t": "<p>En låda med massan 12 kg glider nerför en backe enligt figuren, med konstant hastighet.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"253\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"45.257 51.557 350.743 143.353\"><polygon points=\"60,180 380,180 380,63.5\" fill=\"#D9C4A2\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.1\"/><polygon points=\"60,180 380,180 380,188 60,188\" fill=\"#D9CDBA\"/><g transform=\"translate(204,127.6) rotate(-20)\"><rect x=\"-30\" y=\"-32\" width=\"60\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"0\" y=\"-12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">12 kg</text><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-40\" x2=\"42\" y2=\"-40\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><polygon points=\"48,-40 40,-36 40,-44\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"-45\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v</text></g><path d=\"M 106 180 A 46 46 0 0 0 103.2 164.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">20°</text></svg></span><ol><li>Bestäm friktionskraften som verkar på lådan.</li><li>Bestäm friktionstalet mellan lådan och backen.</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Konstant hastighet innebär noll resultant längs planet.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[f=mg\\sin20^\\circ=12\\cdot9{,}82\\sin20^\\circ=40{,}3\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Dela med normalkraften \\(mg\\cos20^\\circ\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\mu=\\frac{mg\\sin20^\\circ}{mg\\cos20^\\circ}=\\tan20^\\circ=0{,}364\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Friktionskraften är cirka \\(40{,}3\\ \\mathrm N\\) och friktionstalet cirka \\(0{,}36\\).</p></div>",
