        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Konstant hastighet ger \\(f=0{,}32\\ \\mathrm N\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\mu=\\frac fN=\\frac{0{,}32}{0{,}12\\cdot9{,}82}=0{,}272\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(0{,}272\\).</p></div>",
