        "etikett": "b",
        "t": "<p>En fjäder med fjäderkonstanten 120 N/m hänger i taket. I fjädern hängs en vikt med massan 0,80 kg.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg height=\"338\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewbox=\"131.400 8.991 177.000 157.634\" width=\"380\"><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"140\" x2=\"300\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"26\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"140\" x2=\"148\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"150\" x2=\"158\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"160\" x2=\"168\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"170\" x2=\"178\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"180\" x2=\"188\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"190\" x2=\"198\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"200\" x2=\"208\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"210\" x2=\"218\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"220\" x2=\"228\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"230\" x2=\"238\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"240\" x2=\"248\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"250\" x2=\"258\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"260\" x2=\"268\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"270\" x2=\"278\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"280\" x2=\"288\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"290\" x2=\"298\" y1=\"26\" y2=\"18\"></line><polyline fill=\"none\" points=\"220,26 231,29.1538 209,35.4615 231,41.7692 209,48.0769 231,54.3846 209,60.6923 231,67 209,73.3077 231,79.6154 209,85.9231 231,92.2308 209,98.5385 220,108\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></polyline><line stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" x1=\"220\" x2=\"220\" y1=\"108\" y2=\"118\"></line><rect fill=\"#ECEFF3\" height=\"40\" rx=\"3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"60\" x=\"190\" y=\"118\"></rect><text fill=\"#2B2527\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"220\" y=\"143\">0,80 kg</text></svg></span><div class=\"spel-en-del\">Hur långt dras fjädern ut?</div>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Vid jämvikt är fjäderkraften lika stor som tyngdkraften.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[x=\\frac{F_g}{k}=\\frac{7{,}86}{120}=0{,}0655\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(0{,}0655\\ \\mathrm m\\).</p></div>",
        "ledtrad": "<p>Vid jämvikt är fjäderkraften lika stor som tyngdkraften. Använd Hookes lag \\(F=kx\\) för kraften och \\(E_f=kx^2/2\\) för fjäderenergin.</p>",
