    "ledtrad": "<p>Vid tippgränsen är momenten kring tornet lika stora. Välj vridpunkt så att så många okända krafter som möjligt får momentarmen noll.</p>",
    "spelDelning": "deluppgifter",
    "spelIntro": "<p>En byggkran har en motvikt på 4000 kg placerad 6,0 m från tornet.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"327\" width=\"500\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"44.571 2.857 350.857 229.714\"><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"191\" y=\"76\" width=\"18\" height=\"144\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"66\" width=\"290\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"143.2\" y=\"68\" width=\"32\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"365\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"131\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"350\" y=\"131\" width=\"30\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"365\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">last</text><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"159.2\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"47\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"57\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"159.2\" y1=\"47\" x2=\"159.2\" y2=\"57\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#5C575E\">6,0 m</text><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"25\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"35\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"365\" y1=\"25\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"35\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"282\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#5C575E\">15 m</text></svg></span>",
