    "spelIntro": "<p>En pråm med massan 4000 kg bogseras av två bogserbåtar. Varje lina drar med kraften 800 N och bildar vinkeln 30° mot färdriktningen enligt figuren. Vattenmotståndet försummas.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"194\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 61.429 500.000 156.429\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"150\" width=\"470\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#DCE6F2\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"118\" width=\"110\" height=\"40\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"235\" y=\"143\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">4000 kg</text><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"385.263\" y2=\"83\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"393.92,78.00 387.56,86.98 382.96,79.02\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"409.923\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">F₁</text><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"385.263\" y2=\"193\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"393.92,198.00 382.96,196.98 387.56,189.02\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"409.923\" y=\"206\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">F₂</text><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"138\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><path d=\"M 330 138 A 40 40 0 0 0 324.6 118.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"348\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">30°</text><text x=\"348\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">30°</text></svg></span>",
