        "t": "<p>En skivstång med massan 80 kg lyfts rakt uppåt. Under lyftet är accelerationen 0,60 m/s² uppåt.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"278\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewbox=\"51.029 0.000 416.957 231.811\" width=\"500\"><rect fill=\"#DCEAF6\" height=\"10.00\" rx=\"4.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.50\" width=\"280.00\" x=\"70.00\" y=\"98.00\"></rect><rect fill=\"#DCEAF6\" height=\"72.00\" rx=\"3.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.50\" width=\"12.00\" x=\"76.00\" y=\"67.00\"></rect><rect fill=\"#DCEAF6\" height=\"72.00\" rx=\"3.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.50\" width=\"12.00\" x=\"90.00\" y=\"67.00\"></rect><rect fill=\"#DCEAF6\" height=\"72.00\" rx=\"3.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.50\" width=\"12.00\" x=\"318.00\" y=\"67.00\"></rect><rect fill=\"#DCEAF6\" height=\"72.00\" rx=\"3.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.50\" width=\"12.00\" x=\"332.00\" y=\"67.00\"></rect><text fill=\"#2B2527\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"14.5\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"210.00\" y=\"136.00\">80 kg</text><line stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\" stroke-width=\"3.00\" x1=\"210.00\" x2=\"210.00\" y1=\"88.00\" y2=\"37.00\"></line><polygon fill=\"#B43123\" points=\"210.00,26.00 215.06,37.00 204.94,37.00\"></polygon><text fill=\"#B43123\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"13.8\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"210.00\" y=\"16.00\">lyftkraft</text><line stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\" stroke-width=\"3.00\" x1=\"210.00\" x2=\"210.00\" y1=\"150.00\" y2=\"195.00\"></line><polygon fill=\"#B43123\" points=\"210.00,206.00 204.94,195.00 215.06,195.00\"></polygon><text fill=\"#B43123\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"13.8\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"210.00\" y=\"222.00\">tyngdkraft</text><line stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\" stroke-width=\"3.00\" x1=\"418.00\" x2=\"418.00\" y1=\"112.00\" y2=\"77.00\"></line><polygon fill=\"#2A5D9E\" points=\"418.00,66.00 423.06,77.00 412.94,77.00\"></polygon><text fill=\"#2A5D9E\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"13.1\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"410.00\" y=\"160.00\">a = 0,60 m/s²</text></svg></span><div class=\"spel-en-del\">Hur stor är tyngdkraften på stången?</div>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Tyngdkraften verkar nedåt.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F_g=mg=80\\cdot9{,}82=785{,}6\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(785{,}6\\ \\mathrm N\\).</p></div>",
        "ledtrad": "<p>Jämvikt betyder \\(a=0\\), alltså \\(\\sum F=0\\). Dela upp sneda krafter i komponenter om de inte ligger längs samma linje.</p>",
