    "ledtrad": "<p>Rita ett kraftdiagram. Välj axlar längs den viktigaste rörelseriktningen och skriv \\(\\sum F=ma\\) separat i varje riktning.</p>",
    "spelDelning": "deluppgifter",
    "spelIntro": "<p>En mutter dras åt med en skiftnyckel. Handen drar med kraften 120 N vinkelrätt mot nyckeln, 18 cm från mutterns mitt.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg height=\"230\" width=\"380\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"46.800 22.103 234.000 141.355\"><rect x=\"80\" y=\"90\" width=\"190\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"102,100 91,119 69,119 58,100 69,81 91,81\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"100\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><polygon points=\"250,86 245.4,76 254.6,76\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">120 N</text><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"138\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"133\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"143\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"133\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"143\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"165\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">18 cm</text></svg></span>",
