    "spelIntro": "<p>Två barn sitter på en gungbräda som är upplagd på mitten. Barnet till vänster väger 35 kg.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"191\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"31.557 36.288 406.886 125.664\"><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><polygon points=\"235,49 218,86 252,86\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"67\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"67\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"67,96 62.4,86 71.6,86\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"67\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">35 kg</text><line x1=\"347\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"347\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"347,96 342.4,86 351.6,86\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"347\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">?</text><line x1=\"67\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"67,136 74,139 74,133\" fill=\"#5C575E\"/><polygon points=\"235,136 228,139 228,133\" fill=\"#5C575E\"/><text x=\"151\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">1,5 m</text><line x1=\"235\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"347\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"235,136 242,139 242,133\" fill=\"#5C575E\"/><polygon points=\"347,136 340,139 340,133\" fill=\"#5C575E\"/><text x=\"291\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">1,0 m</text></svg></span>",
