    "poang": "(2/1/0)",
    "t": "<p>En mobil består av en lätt stång som hänger i en tråd. Stången är i jämvikt. Stångens egen massa försummas.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg height=\"233\" width=\"380\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"101.429 7.857 297.143 182.308\"><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"26\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"218\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"230\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"238\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"248\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"268\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"278\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"288\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"298\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"318\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"115\" y=\"65\" width=\"270\" height=\"10\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#E5EDF4\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"70\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"116\" y=\"110\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"129\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">300 g</text><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"336\" y=\"110\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"129\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">?</text><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"168\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"173\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"173\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">20 cm</text><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"168\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"173\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"173\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">40 cm</text></svg></span>\n<ol><li>Hur stor är tyngdkraften på den vänstra figuren?</li>\n<li>Hur stort moment ger den kring upphängningspunkten?</li>\n<li>Vilken hävarm har den högra figuren?</li>\n<li>Vilken massa har den högra figuren?</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><p class=\"facit-metod\"><strong>Tänk så här:</strong> Frilägg föremålet och rita bara de krafter som verkligen verkar på det. Dela upp sneda krafter och använd Newtons lag i en riktning i taget.</p><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Den vänstra figurens tyngdkraft är</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F_V=0{,}300\\cdot9{,}82=2{,}946\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Beräkna momentet kring upphängningspunkten.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[M_V=2{,}946\\cdot0{,}20=0{,}5892\\ \\mathrm{Nm}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Den högra figurens hävarm är enligt figuren</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[l_H=0{,}40\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Momentjämvikt ger den högra figurens tyngdkraft och massa.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F_H=\\frac{0{,}5892}{0{,}40}=1{,}473\\ \\mathrm N\\]\\[m_H=\\frac{1{,}473}{9{,}82}=0{,}150\\ \\mathrm{kg}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Den vänstra tyngdkraften är \\(2{,}95\\ \\mathrm N\\) och momentet \\(0{,}589\\ \\mathrm{Nm}\\). Den högra hävarmen är 0,40 m och massan \\(0{,}150\\ \\mathrm{kg}\\).</p><p class=\"facit-not\"><strong>Kontroll och insikt:</strong> Kontrollera om resultanten ska vara noll eller ge en acceleration, och att kraftens riktning stämmer med situationen.</p></div>",
