        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">När friktionen tar 12 J återstår 33 J.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[E_k=45-12=33\\ \\mathrm J\\]\\[v=\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\cdot33}{3{,}0}}=4{,}69\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(4{,}69\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\).</p></div>",
