        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Stighöjden är</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[h=\\frac{E_f}{mg}=4{,}58\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(4{,}58\\ \\mathrm m\\).</p></div>",
