        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">I den oelastiska stöten bevaras rörelsemängden.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[v=\\frac{2{,}0\\cdot3{,}964}{5{,}0}=1{,}586\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(1{,}586\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\).</p></div>",
