    "familjNyckelTidigare": "rorelsemangd__fullstandigt_oelastisk_kollision",
    "ledtrad": "<p>Välj en positiv riktning och skriv rörelsemängden med tecken: \\(p=mv\\). I ett isolerat kollisionsförlopp gäller \\(\\sum p_{före}=\\sum p_{efter}\\), och impuls är \\(I=\\Delta p\\).</p>",
    "spelDelning": "deluppgifter",
    "spelIntro": "<p>En kula med massan 8,0 g skjuts in i ett träblock med massan 1,20 kg som hänger i ett snöre. Kulan fastnar i blocket, och blocket svänger upp 12 cm.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"301\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"52.171 13.191 355.771 172.739\"><rect x=\"120\" y=\"22\" width=\"220\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#DCEAF6\"/><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"31\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"31\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"31\" r=\"3.6\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"31\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"120\" width=\"60\" height=\"56\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"31\" x2=\"281\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/><rect x=\"251\" y=\"84\" width=\"60\" height=\"56\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"176\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/><line x1=\"311\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/><line x1=\"356\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"356\" y2=\"176\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"351\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"361\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"351\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"361\" y2=\"176\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"364\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">12 cm</text><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"148\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"162\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"172,148 162,152.6 162,143.4\" fill=\"#B43123\"/></svg></span>",
