        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Före krocken är energin</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[E_{k,i}=\\frac{900\\cdot15^2}{2}\\approx101250\\ \\mathrm{J}=101{,}25\\ \\mathrm{kJ}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(101{,}25\\ \\mathrm{kJ}\\).</p></div>",
