        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Bil B:s energier är 49,59 kJ respektive 198,35 kJ.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\frac{s_{\\mathrm{el}}}{s_{\\mathrm{oel}}}=\\frac{198{,}35}{49{,}59}=4{,}00\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(4{,}00\\).</p></div>",
