    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Samma ström 30 mA går genom \\(R_1\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[U_1=120\\cdot0{,}030=3{,}6\\ \\mathrm V\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Den återstående delspänningen är</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[U_2=9{,}0-3{,}6=5{,}4\\ \\mathrm V\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Den okända resistansen blir</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[R_2=\\frac{5{,}4}{0{,}030}=180\\ \\Omega\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Kontroll från hela kretsen:</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[R_e=\\frac{9{,}0}{0{,}030}=300\\ \\Omega=120+180\\ \\Omega\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(U_1=3{,}6\\ \\mathrm V\\), \\(U_2=5{,}4\\ \\mathrm V\\), \\(R_2=180\\ \\Omega\\), och \\(R_e=300\\ \\Omega\\).</p></div>",
