        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Sätt den passerande andelen till 0,010.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[0{,}010=2^{-x/1{,}2}\\Rightarrow x=1{,}2\\frac{\\ln(100)}{\\ln2}=7{,}97\\ \\mathrm{cm}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(7{,}97\\ \\mathrm{cm}\\).</p></div>",
